    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE NATIONAL INSTITUTE OF BUSINESSMANAGEMENT LAW, NO. 23 OF 1976",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      163.29,
      262.97,
      401.79,
      286.31
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      163.29,
      298.97,
      401.93,
      322.31
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the National Institute ofBusiness Management (Amendment) Act, No. of 2013.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      163.29,
      334.97,
      401.86,
      394.31
    ],
    "text": "2. Section 6 of the National Institute of BusinessManagement Law, No. 23 of 1976 is hereby amended insubsection (1) of that section, by the repeal of the paragraphs(a) and (b) thereof, and the substitution therefor, of thefollowing new paragraphs:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      174.57,
      406.97,
      377.85,
      418.31
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(a)the following ex-officio members, namely _",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      205.29,
      430.97,
      401.77,
      454.31
    ],
    "text": "(i)the Director-General of the Instituteappointed under section 16;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      202.29,
      466.97,
      401.76,
      502.31
    ],
    "text": "(ii)the President or Vice President of theFederation of Chambers of Commerce andIndustry of Sri Lanka;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      199.29,
      511.97,
      401.77,
      535.31
    ],
    "text": "(iii)the President or Vice President of theNational Chamber of Commerce of Sri Lanka;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      200.13,
      544.97,
      401.75,
      580.31
    ],
    "text": "(iv)the Director of the Postgraduate Institute ofManagement established under theUniversities Act, No. 16 of 1978;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      203.13,
      589.97,
      401.76,
      637.31
    ],
    "text": "(v)Secretary to the Ministry of the Minister incharge of the subject of Technical andVocational Education and Training or SeniorOfficer nominated by the Secretary;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      200.13,
      646.97,
      401.77,
      670.31
    ],
